  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Uncle Junior** (1 review): The track labeled Cannonball is really Uncle Junior, per the reviewer's correction [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **thanks**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2014-10-31.tlm170.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 11 songs; 79 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says this audience recording sounds great [3]\n- **soulive2014-10-31.tlm170.flac24**: audience recording; 11 songs; 79 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Only the original trio played, with no guests and no Shady Horns [1]\n- The show was part of the Royal Family Ball; Soulive played first and Lettuce followed [1]\n- Only the original trio played, with no guests and no Shady Horns [2]\n- The show was part of the Royal Family Ball; Soulive played first and Lettuce followed [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2014-10-31.tlm170.flac16**: taped by Scott Bernstein; transferred by Scott Bernstein; source: Audience [1]. Also: Scott Bernstein recorded, mastered, tracked, tagged and posted it in November 2014; one clap was removed from track 6 [1]\n- **soulive2014-10-31.tlm170.flac24**: taped by Scott Bernstein; transferred by Scott Bernstein; source: Audience [2]. Also: This is the 24-bit version, recorded and posted by Scott Bernstein in November 2014; one clap was removed from track 6 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Mark Dershowitz: [Royal Family Halloween Ball 10.31.14 Terminal 5 | TheWaster.com](https://www.thewaster.com/photography/royal-family-halloween-ball-10-31-14-terminal-5/) [5]\n- Poster by Mark Dershowitz: [Royal Family Halloween Ball 10.31.14 Terminal 5 | TheWaster.com](https://www.thewaster.com/photography/royal-family-halloween-ball-10-31-14-terminal-5/) [6]\n- Poster by Mark Dershowitz: [Royal Family Halloween Ball 10.31.14 Terminal 5 | TheWaster.com](https://www.thewaster.com/photography/royal-family-halloween-ball-10-31-14-terminal-5/) [7]\n- Poster by Mark Dershowitz: [Royal Family Halloween Ball 10.31.14 Terminal 5 | TheWaster.com](https://www.thewaster.com/photography/royal-family-halloween-ball-10-31-14-terminal-5/) [8]\n- Fan art by Mark Dershowitz: [Royal Family Halloween Ball 10.31.14 Terminal 5 | TheWaster.com](https://www.thewaster.com/photography/royal-family-halloween-ball-10-31-14-terminal-5/) [9]",
